        "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Fireflies</strong> is a 3D adventure healing game set in a world where light and darkness intertwine.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As a small spirit searching for lost lights, players journey through a forest that shifts between day and night — bringing brightness back to a lake swallowed by darkness.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4056020/extras/00661d92306d0a8396efa11ad687e2c4.avif?t=1765800847\" width=1560 height=461 /></span>  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Time in this world has stopped in an endless night.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The only thing that can illuminate the sky is the faint glow of the fireflies that have lost their light.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Yet, during brief moments when day breaks through, the world reveals hidden landscapes and truths that cannot be seen in the dark.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Gameplay</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Ability to <strong>switch between day and night</strong>, revealing new paths and secrets.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4056020/extras/c4863699707a292ecfb05e1d83adeb2c.poster.avif?t=1765800847\" width=426 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4056020/extras/c4863699707a292ecfb05e1d83adeb2c.webm?t=1765800847\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4056020/extras/c4863699707a292ecfb05e1d83adeb2c.mp4?t=1765800847\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Emotionally immersive atmosphere</strong> with gentle lighting and sound.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4056020/extras/22eff7224870f5b5646d7cbd876883e3.avif?t=1765800847\" width=1560 height=877 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Nature-based platforming</strong> that blends exploration and environmental interaction.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4056020/extras/c4485fa8447dc6eaab79392149a07b94.poster.avif?t=1765800847\" width=426 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4056020/extras/c4485fa8447dc6eaab79392149a07b94.webm?t=1765800847\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4056020/extras/c4485fa8447dc6eaab79392149a07b94.mp4?t=1765800847\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Progression &amp; Objective</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Players explore the forest, completing objectives in each area as they follow the path guided by mysterious mushrooms.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Playtime</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Approximately <strong>15 minutes</strong> for the main story.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Genre &amp; Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Genre: <strong>3D Adventure / Exploration / Healing / Platformer</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Mode: <strong>Single-player / Keyboard supported</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Soundtrack: Original acoustic and emotional background music</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A small light wandering through the darkness — and at the end of that journey, the story of finding one’s true self.</p>",
